{"id":"f70d3e40a3983162","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-elementary-back-and-forth.md","title":"Back and Forth","display":"df-elementary-back-and-forth — Back and Forth","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elementary-back-and-forth","aliases":["58-df-elementary-back-and-forth","Back and Forth"],"display":"df-elementary-back-and-forth — Back and Forth","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elementary-back-and-forth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elementary-back-and-forth</span><span>Back and Forth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-back-and-forth — Back and Forth"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"956886494eb436aa\" href=\"?note=956886494eb436aa\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md\">../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\)</span>（同一语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 的结构，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N))\">\\(I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N))\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"956886494eb436aa\" href=\"?note=956886494eb436aa\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md\">../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>（本文件定义）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}back\\text{-}forth} \\vdash \\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S(I,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall p\\in I\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(q))\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}back\\text{-}forth} \\vdash \\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S(I,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall p\\in I\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(q))\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Back-and-forth: Fraïssé construction for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>-homogeneous structures</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>-categorical: back-and-forth shows any two countable models are elementarily equivalent</li>\n<li>Game characterization: player II wins EF-game <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Leftrightarrow\">\\(\\Leftrightarrow\\)</span> back-and-forth exists</li>\n<li>Amalgamation: combine structures via back-and-forth; construct universal homogeneous models</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hodges, A Shorter Model Theory</li>\n<li>Rothschild and Wolf, Rules of the Back-and-Forth Boards</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"956886494eb436aa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)$（同一语言 $\\mathcal L$ 的结构，see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"956886494eb436aa","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)$（see [[../batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\times\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}back\\text{-}forth} \\vdash \\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S(I,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall p\\in I\\;\\left(\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(q))\\land\\forall b\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\;\\exists q\\in I\\;(p\\subseteq q\\land b\\in\\operatorname{ran}(q))\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Leftrightarrow","display":false}],"bytes":1911,"backlinks":[{"id":"191314cfce5f895b","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BackAndForth}_S$ (back-and-forth predicate, see [[58-df-elementary-back-and-forth]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-314","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-elementary-back-and-forth]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-466","locations":["正文"],"count":1,